    %% Vector Insert Flow
    Note over Client,Cloud: Vector Insert Operation (Test Status: 1,372 passed, 0 failed, 35 ignored)
    
    Client->>+REST: POST /collections/{id}/vectors<br/> JSON Batch (500 vectors)
    REST->>+Handler: insert_vectors_unified()<br/> JSON → Proto
    Handler->>+DVS: insert_vectors_direct()<br/> Direct Memtable Access
    
    Note over DVS:  Engine Routing Decision<br/>Collection Service Available?
    
    alt Collection Service Configured
        DVS->>+CS: get_collection_storage_engine(collection_id)
        CS-->>-DVS: "SST" | "VIPER" | Error
    else No Collection Service (Current Issue)
        Note over DVS:  Defaults to VIPER<br/>(Known routing limitation)
    end
    
    alt VIPER Engine (Default)
        DVS->>+VIPER: do_flush()<br/> Columnar Storage
        VIPER->>+Atomic: begin_atomic_operation()<br/> ACID Transaction
        Atomic->>+Cloud: write_to_staging()<br/> Creates .parquet files
        Cloud-->>-Atomic:  Write Confirmed
        Atomic-->>-VIPER:  Transaction ID
        VIPER-->>-DVS:  Insert Complete
    else SST Engine (If Configured)  
        DVS->>+SST: do_flush()<br/> Row-based Storage
        SST->>+Atomic: begin_atomic_operation()<br/> ACID Transaction
        Atomic->>+Cloud: write_sstables()<br/> Creates .sst files
        Cloud-->>-Atomic:  Write Confirmed
        Atomic-->>-SST:  Transaction ID
        SST-->>-DVS:  Insert Complete
    end
    
    DVS-->>-Handler:  Batch Inserted
    Handler-->>-REST:  Proto → JSON Response
    REST-->>-Client:  Insert Stats<br/> 10-49K vectors/sec
    
